      "comment": "Zarechnaya: Izmaylov's death",
      "content": "Zarechnaya repeats the account that the previous Chairperson died of a sudden illness. In the World Quest Disputes Without Honor and Humanity the High Table doubts that it was illness, and the wiki's Izmaylov page records his adopted son Vasiliy as his killer. She is not shown knowing any of this, and the dialogue never says she suspects murder, only that she senses hidden documents.",
